@host = http://localhost:5062

### List recipes
GET {{host}}/api/recipes

### Create a valid batch (use a recipeId from the call above)
POST {{host}}/api/batches
Content-Type: application/json

{ "recipeId": 1, "plannedQuantityKg": 200 }

### Invalid: quantity above mixer capacity (expect 400)
POST {{host}}/api/batches
Content-Type: application/json

{ "recipeId": 1, "plannedQuantityKg": 900 }

### Invalid: unknown recipe (expect 400)
POST {{host}}/api/batches
Content-Type: application/json

{ "recipeId": 999, "plannedQuantityKg": 100 }

### List batches
GET {{host}}/api/batches

### Preview the XML for a batch (replace the ID)
GET {{host}}/api/batches/B-20261016-001/xml

### Send a batch to the ERP simulator (needs the simulator running on 5063)
POST {{host}}/api/batches/B-20261016-001/submit

### Detail with the event log AND the XML messages sent (use an "id" from "messages" below)
GET {{host}}/api/batches/B-20261016-001

### The XML of one stored message, exactly as it was sent
GET {{host}}/api/messages/1/xml

### --- Mixer and tank inventory ---

### Start a Ready batch: doses the tanks and begins the mixer cycle (400 if a tank is short)
POST {{host}}/api/batches/B-20261016-001/start

### Simulate a fault while a batch is Running
POST {{host}}/api/batches/B-20261016-001/fault

### Tank levels
GET {{host}}/api/tanks

### Material ledger (newest first)
GET {{host}}/api/tanks/movements?limit=20

### Refill a tank (A or B), up to its 1000 kg capacity
POST {{host}}/api/tanks/A/refill
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantityKg": 300 }

### --- ERP simulator controls (port 5063) ---

### Current ERP mode and accepted batches
GET http://localhost:5063/admin/mode

### Make the ERP refuse everything (batches become Error)
PUT http://localhost:5063/admin/mode
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mode": "RejectAll" }

### Make the ERP "go down" (submit returns 503, batch stays Created)
PUT http://localhost:5063/admin/mode
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mode": "Unavailable" }

### Back to normal rules (rejects over 450 kg and duplicates)
PUT http://localhost:5063/admin/mode
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mode": "Normal" }

### Batch detail with event log (replace the ID)
GET {{host}}/api/batches/B-20261016-001
